"A Thiron pit lord secretly owns the Sun City arena and its imp baron through a true soul contract."
"The pit lord holds the imp baron's daughter hostage to keep him obedient."
"Many claimed soul contracts are facsimiles, weaker than a true soul contract."
"A soul contract ends at once if its holder dies with no agreed heir, or can no longer use magic."
"If a bound demon dies, the contracts it held pass to its own master."
"Thiron demons sell evolving monsters to Malari lords, each tamed by a Ring of Control."
"Only the pit lord who made them can forge more Rings of Control, and a master ring may exist."
"The pit lord fears gods will aim a Mana Manipulator at demons, and wants any such one as his pawn."
